### ============================
### CUSTOMER SERVICE (:8081)
### ============================

### Créer un client
POST http://localhost:8081/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mohamed",
  "lastName": "Ali",
  "email": "mohamed@test.com",
  "phone": "+33612345678",
  "address": "10 rue de la Paix",
  "city": "Paris",
  "zipCode": "75001"
}

### Créer un 2e client
POST http://localhost:8081/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Tasnime",
  "lastName": "Martin",
  "email": "sophie@test.com",
  "phone": "+33698765432",
  "address": "25 boulevard Haussmann",
  "city": "Paris",
  "zipCode": "75009"
}

### Lister les clients
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers?page=0&size=10

### Récupérer un client
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers/1

### Vérifier existence
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers/1/exists

### Rechercher par ville
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers/search?city=Paris

### Test validation - email invalide
POST http://localhost:8081/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "X",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "phone": "abc",
  "address": "test",
  "city": "Paris",
  "zipCode": "123"
}

### ============================
### RESTAURANT SERVICE (:8082)
### ============================

### Créer un restaurant
POST http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Le Petit Bistrot",
  "cuisine": "Française",
  "address": "5 avenue des Champs-Élysées",
  "city": "Paris",
  "phone": "+33143556677",
  "openingTime": "09:00",
  "closingTime": "23:00"
}

### Créer un 2e restaurant
POST http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tokyo Ramen",
  "cuisine": "Japonaise",
  "address": "12 rue Sainte-Anne",
  "city": "Paris",
  "phone": "+33142334455",
  "openingTime": "11:30",
  "closingTime": "22:00"
}

### Ajouter des plats au restaurant 1
POST http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants/1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Steak Frites",
  "description": "Steak grillé avec frites maison et salade",
  "price": 18.50,
  "category": "MAIN",
  "allergens": "gluten"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants/1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Soupe à l'oignon",
  "description": "Soupe gratinée traditionnelle",
  "price": 9.00,
  "category": "STARTER"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants/1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Crème Brûlée",
  "description": "Crème vanille avec caramel croustillant",
  "price": 8.00,
  "category": "DESSERT",
  "allergens": "lactose, oeufs"
}

### Ajouter des plats au restaurant 2
POST http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants/2/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ramen Tonkotsu",
  "description": "Bouillon porc, chashu, oeuf mollet, nori",
  "price": 14.00,
  "category": "MAIN"
}

### Lister les restaurants
GET http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants

### Récupérer un restaurant avec son menu
GET http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants/1

### Recherche par cuisine
GET http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants/search?cuisine=Française

### Vérifier existence d'un plat
GET http://localhost:8082/api/restaurants/1/dishes/1/exists

