### ============================
### ORDER SERVICE (:8083)
### ============================

### Passer une commande (flux complet)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "deliveryAddress": "10 rue de la Paix, 75001 Paris",
  "items": [
    { "dishId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "dishId": 3, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Récupérer la commande
GET http://localhost:8083/api/orders/1

### Vue agrégée complète
GET http://localhost:8083/api/orders/1/full

### Commandes d'un client
GET http://localhost:8083/api/orders/customer/1

### Mettre à jour le statut
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### ============================
### TESTS D'ERREUR
### ============================

### Commande avec client inexistant → 422
POST http://localhost:8083/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999,
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "deliveryAddress": "Somewhere",
  "items": [{ "dishId": 1, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Commande avec montant insuffisant → 422
POST http://localhost:8083/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "deliveryAddress": "Somewhere",
  "items": [{ "dishId": 3, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Transition de statut invalide → 422
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}

### ============================
### DELIVERY STATUS FLOW
### ============================

### Récupérer la livraison
GET http://localhost:8084/api/deliveries/1

### Progression: ASSIGNED → PICKED_UP
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PICKED_UP"
}

### Progression: PICKED_UP → IN_TRANSIT
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT"
}

### Progression: IN_TRANSIT → DELIVERED
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}

### Test transition invalide: PENDING → DELIVERED
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}
